{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/king-zombie-battle.gif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Valiant Saga is a brutal 2D action-platformer with RPG elements.</strong> Explore cursed kingdoms filled with danger and mystery.<br><br><strong>Traverse a wide variety of hand-crafted environments</strong>, from snowy hills and dusty ruins to blood soaked catacombs and volcanic valleys.<br><br>Face hordes of abysmal creatures in intense battles, brought to life with dynamic pixel art and <strong>a powerful original power metal soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/01-title.png?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush enemies with your two-handed axe. Combo, dash, and execute your foes in blood-soaked battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiant-saga-visceral-fighting-2.gif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/02-title.png?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurl a fiery spinning axe and master devastating abilities like fire dashes and thunder strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiantThunder.gif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/03-title.png?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a wide variety of handcrafted environments in pixel art, enhanced by dramatic lighting, weather, and rich environmental detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/exploration-2.gif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/04-title.png?t=1748471611\" /></div>Solve challenging puzzles, help villagers, and overcome deadly dungeons traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/vs-rpg-features-2.gif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/05-title.png?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the battle through a fully original and immersive power metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1526890?t=1748471611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1526890?t=1748471611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748471611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748471611